      "id": "claim_7bc16f9c4a024d198af29fd93e9c787c",
      "statement": "catalog.py runs _self_check() at import, rejecting catalogued tables with no columns or primary key and foreign keys referencing tables or columns missing from the catalog; KNOWN_EXCLUDED holds tables intentionally outside the catalog such as checkpoints, users, threads, proposals and schema_migrations.",
