    {
      "id": "claim_fb350b17ad4144858ed5fe95a4a89e43",
      "statement": "0048_proposal_work.sql is the worked example for changing an existing table: it adds NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}' jsonb columns work and summary to proposals, changes write access with ALTER POLICY on proposals_insert, proposals_update and documents_insert, and ends with a DO-block guard that raises, rolling back the transaction, if any table readable by anon or authenticated lacks a read policy. proposals is in KNOWN_EXCLUDED, so no catalog change was needed.",
