      "statement": "0050_proposal_stage_shift.sql is the latest migration (so the next file is 0051) and is a data-only UPDATE with no DDL: it increments work.stage, and summary.stage when present, for proposals at stage 3 or later, so it is only correct because the runner applies each recorded file once.",
