      "statement": "After the SQL files succeed, migrate.py's main() also migrates LangGraph's checkpointer tables (PostgresSaver.setup, or a read-only version report with --status). It is in the runner rather than at boot so langgraph upgrades migrate deliberately; the backend's open_checkpointer does no DDL and raises RuntimeError telling the operator to run make migrate if the database is not at CHECKPOINT_VERSION.",
